cription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4332209698,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAjhGIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:multiplayer","name":"topic:multiplayer","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-06-04T19:09:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T23:35:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS - MPB M1 Max\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a scene inherits from a scene that contains a `MultiplayerSynchronizer` node and you edit the configuration to add new properties, it propagates to the parent with some errors printed in the log and marks that scene as dirty if it is open.\n\nThis can cause issues with unexpected properties synchrinizing but can lead to worse issues when the property that is configured to sync doesn't exist on the base type.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. open provided MRP\n2. open both the base and inherited scenes\n3. inside of the inherited scene, navigate to the `MultiplayerSpawner` and add the root node's `rotation` property to the list\n4. save the scene\n5. observe that the base scene is now marked as dirty and if you look at the `MultiplayerSpawner` node inside it has received the configuration from the inherited scene.\n6. observe error spam in the output.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28609773/godot-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120015/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}